{
  "key": 58383,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Oh, hello, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It’s nice to see you again when\f",
        "we aren’t in a time of crisis.\r",
        "Perhaps you’d be interested in a\n",
        "bit of trading?\r",
        "I’ve got a Chansey I’d be willing\n",
        "to trade with you.\r",
        "Have you got a Munchlax? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for trading with me.\n",
        "I always wanted to try raising\f",
        "a Snorlax."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm? I don’t think that’s a\n",
        "Munchlax, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "You don’t want to trade?\n",
        "Well, that’s a shame."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "It amazes me just how much Munchlax\n",
        "eats. It’s expensive, but I wouldn’t\f",
        "give it up for the world!\r",
        "But enough about my end,\n",
        "how is Chansey doing?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! We should have\n",
        "a battle when we get stronger!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: Oh... {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\n",
        "It’s good to see you are well...\r",
        "We should battle at some point...\n",
        "I’d like that...\r",
        "Just a bit..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Ohh! Mira has been waiting\n",
        "for you to show up!\r",
        "Mira wants to know if\n",
        "you’d like to battle! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "You don’t want to?\n",
        "Mira is disappointed..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira found that fun. Mira wonders if\n",
        "she can get stronger..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira will show {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} how strong\n",
        "she has gotten!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Marley: Hello...\n",
        "We’ve both grown quite strong...\r",
        "Might you...\n",
        "Wish to battle me? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00012",
      "en_US": "Oh... You can be that mean?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00013",
      "en_US": "Excellent... Let’s get started...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "That was enjoyable...\n",
        "I like battling with you...\r",
        "Just a tiny bit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: I hope my Chansey is\n",
        "doing well with you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "In the meanwhile, would you\n",
        "like to have a battle? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "I guess Pokémon aren’t always\n",
        "able to fight, right?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Giggle... This should be fun!\r",
        "But let me warn you, my Pokémon\n",
        "can be quite rambunctious!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Being a Trainer isn’t easy. The more\n",
        "you battle, the more you discover.\r",
        "But being a Trainer is very rewarding,\n",
        "wouldn’t you say?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0590_T25R0801_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "After the conclusion of the trade, a\n",
        "mysterious sphere appeared in midair...\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
